# The pipeline scripts were historically stored CRLF; any tool that reads and
# rewrites one in text mode converted the whole file to LF and produced diffs
# where every line changed (gen_report.js: 1891 diff lines for 9 real edits —
# see the 2026-08-28 handoff, patches/APPLYING.md). Pin the working formats so
# this stops recurring. *.sh must be LF regardless: a CRLF checkout once turned
# the hook-lab logger into a blanket PreToolUse blocker under dash.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text
*.js   text
*.json text
*.md   text
